  m_text: '<b><size=32><style=coinColor>GOLDEN CUB SPINS</size></style></b>

    <size=24>BEAR CUB LOCKED WILD Free Spin Feature:

    3, 4 or 5 SCATTER Symbols triggers 5, 8 or 12 Free Spins.

    <size=10>

    </size>Player will be presented with 3 bear cubs to choose from. Chosen Bear Cub

    will turn WILD for all Free Spins. Any WILD appearing anywhere in the

    Reel Window will Lock into place and remain WILD for rest of Free Spin

    Series. Free Spins cannot be re-triggered.'
